## License Types

### 1. SaaS License (Subscription)
- **Starter Plan**: $29/month
  - Up to 50 documents per month
  - 1 user account
  - Basic AI models (GPT-3.5, Claude Haiku)
  - Email support

- **Professional Plan**: $99/month
  - Unlimited documents
  - Up to 5 user accounts
  - All AI models (GPT-4, Claude Sonnet/Opus)
  - Priority support
  - API access

- **Enterprise Plan**: Custom pricing
  - Unlimited everything
  - White-label solution
  - Custom integrations
  - Dedicated support
  - SLA guarantee

### 2. Self-Hosted License (One-time)
- **Standard**: $999 one-time
  - Deploy on 1 server
  - Up to 10 users
  - 1 year updates
  - Email support

- **Professional**: $2,999 one-time
  - Deploy on up to 5 servers
  - Unlimited users
  - 2 years updates
  - Priority support

- **Enterprise**: Custom pricing
  - Unlimited deployments
  - Source code escrow
  - Custom development
  - Dedicated support

### 3. API Access License
- **Pay-per-use**: $0.01 per document operation
- **Monthly tiers** available at discounted rates

